# ---- DATA: unpublished -- NEVER commit or push ---------------------------
# Everything inside data/ is ignored except the README.
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/checksums.md5
!data/check_data.sh
!data/check_data.R
# Just in case someone puts data files elsewhere:
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.parquet
*.h5ad
*.rds
*.RData
*.rda
*.tsv.gz
*.csv.gz
combined_site*.tsv
*.fasta
*.gff

# ---- Rendered exercise notebooks and Quarto caches ------------------------
# analyses/_output/ holds the WORKED exercise notebooks -- never commit those,
# they give the answers away. Your own final report goes in reports/ and IS
# committed (see "Handing in" in README.md).
analyses/_output/
analyses/*_files/
analyses/.quarto/
.quarto/
reports/*_files/

# ---- R / RStudio / OS ------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rproj.user/
.Renviron
renv/library/
renv/staging/
.DS_Store
